'Cannabis is prohibited in Monaco under the Criminal Code and drug control legislation. As a city-state closely integrated with France, Monaco''s drug policy is strongly influenced by French prohibition. There is no medical cannabis program. Monaco''s very small territory and wealthy population create unique enforcement dynamics.',
