'Montenegro decriminalized possession of small amounts of cannabis for personal use, treating it as a minor offense subject to fines rather than criminal prosecution. There is no medical cannabis program. Montenegro''s EU accession candidacy creates some alignment pressure toward harm reduction approaches, but no formal medical framework has been enacted.',
