'Cannabis is prohibited in Romania under Law 143/2000 on Preventing and Combating Illicit Drug Trafficking and Use. Romania has one of the stricter enforcement postures among EU member states. There is no medical cannabis program. CBD products exist in commercial channels but face regulatory uncertainty. EU membership creates some harmonization pressure.',
