'Romania Law 143/2000; ANMDM pharmaceutical registry; EMCDDA Romania report','Current as of Q2 2026','Annual','Country-level briefing noting strict prohibition in EU context',DATE '2026-06-21','[]'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,'reviewed'
