SELECT 'san-marino','country','SM','Prohibited',
'Cannabis is prohibited in San Marino. As a microstate surrounded by Italy, San Marino''s legal framework is influenced by Italian policy. There is no medical cannabis program. Cannabis light products available in Italy have created some cross-border market dynamics, but San Marino has not established any independent cannabis regulatory framework.',
'No legal patient access exists. Cannabis-based medicines are unavailable through official Sammarinese healthcare channels.',
'San Marino physicians cannot prescribe cannabis under the existing legal framework.',
'No licensed cannabis market exists in this microstate. Italian cannabis light products may informally influence consumer patterns given geographic integration.',
'No independent reform is anticipated. San Marino''s policy is strongly influenced by Italian precedent.',
'Guardia di Rocca and Corpo della Gendarmeria handle law enforcement including drug enforcement. Secretary of State for Health oversees pharmaceutical regulation.',
'San Marino drug control legislation; Italian policy alignment monitoring; microstate regulatory context','Current as of Q2 2026','Annual','Country-level briefing noting prohibition in Italian-adjacent microstate context',DATE '2026-06-21','[]'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,'reviewed'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM cc_jurisdiction_briefings WHERE country_iso2='SM' AND jurisdiction_type='country');
